  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 0.84,
      "e": 1.76,
      "text": "- It was pretty eye opening."
    },
    {
      "s": 1.76,
      "e": 5.1,
      "text": "It was my first time ever seeing any kinda hurricane damage."
    },
    {
      "s": 5.1,
      "e": 7.14,
      "text": "I was responsible for overseeing"
    },
    {
      "s": 7.14,
      "e": 8.85,
      "text": "salvage and cleanup contractors,"
    },
    {
      "s": 8.85,
      "e": 13.21,
      "text": "removing vessels from Texas waterways"
    },
    {
      "s": 13.21,
      "e": 14.96,
      "text": "that had sunk due to the hurricane."
    },
    {
      "s": 14.96,
      "e": 18.62,
      "text": "(bright instrumental music)"
    },
    {
      "s": 22.62,
      "e": 24.09,
      "text": "We did have some vessels that were able"
    },
    {
      "s": 24.09,
      "e": 27.28,
      "text": "to pump off any kind of fuel or other oil products"
    },
    {
      "s": 27.28,
      "e": 29.81,
      "text": "before they actually made it into the water."
    },
    {
      "s": 29.81,
      "e": 31.63,
      "text": "If we we observed any kind of machine"
    },
    {
      "s": 31.63,
      "e": 33.53,
      "text": "or oil product in the water,"
    },
    {
      "s": 33.53,
      "e": 36.24,
      "text": "we deployed oil absorbents to clean it up out"
    },
    {
      "s": 36.24,
      "e": 38.9,
      "text": "of the water as well as a containment boom."
    },
    {
      "s": 38.9,
      "e": 42.46,
      "text": "(bright instrumental music)"
    },
    {
      "s": 42.46,
      "e": 44.28,
      "text": "It's important to prevent pollution"
    },
    {
      "s": 44.28,
      "e": 47.67,
      "text": "for the environment as well as public safety and health."
    },
    {
      "s": 47.67,
